sequenceDiagram
 participant B as Business transaction
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant R as Relay handler mode
 participant Q as Upstash Redis REST
 participant W as Worker handler mode
 participant E as Brevo HTTPS API
 B->>DB: BEGIN and business + audit + inbox + email delivery
 B->>DB: COMMIT
 Note over R,W: Authenticated invocations, independent activation flags
 R->>DB: Claim committed publish leases, limit 5
 R->>Q: Publish delivery IDs only
 R->>DB: Mark published or release lease
 W->>Q: Peek bounded IDs
 W->>DB: Claim send lease and load stored payload
 W->>E: Send transactional email
 alt Provider accepted
 E-->>W: Acceptance identifier
 W->>DB: Record sent outcome
 W->>Q: Acknowledge pointer
 else Throttled or ambiguous
 E-->>W: Retryable response or unknown outcome
 W->>DB: Record bounded retry or uncertain state
 Note over DB,W: Uncertain outcomes require reconciliation, not blind resend
 end
